<title>USA: U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mostly lower.</title>
<headline>U.S. Spring/White Wheat - Spring bids mostly lower.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dark northern spring bids were mostly weaker on Wednesday as several dealers noted a pickup in farm sales.</p>
<p>&quot;Wheat was moving and there is farmer selling,&quot; a Minnesota dealer said.</p>
<p>A merchandiser in North Dakota said grain was coming into the elevator. In Montana, another dealer also noted some movement.</p>
<p>In the Pacific Northwest, a Washington state merchandiser added that a shipment of white wheat was bought early this morning.</p>
<p>MGE spring wheat futures closed mixed with March up 3/4 at $3.91-1/2 a bushel.  </p>
